     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div>Dear All,</div><div><br></div><div>I&#39;m writing to ask for your help and input on an issue I am facing. Currently, I am following the tutorial provided in the documentation of the <b>SegOptim. </b>So in section <b>4, </b>everything is working fine but in section <b>4.5 Run OTB image segmentation, </b>I am receiving an error. I have attached the error image and code in word file. Please help me in this regard and much appreciated. </div><div><br></div><div>With kind regards</div><div>Fowad</div></div>"
